### List only the authenticated student's or assigned teacher's lessons.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/lessons?schoolId={{schoolId}}&from=2030-01-07T08:00:00Z&to=2030-01-07T08:45:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Reconcile an ambiguous command using the same operation identity.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scheduling-operations/{{operationId}}?schoolId={{schoolId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Find bounded provisional slots without exposing foreign calendars.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/availability?branchId={{branchId}}&teacherId={{teacherId}}&category=B&from=2030-01-07T08:00:00Z&to=2030-01-07T08:45:00Z&durationMinutes=45&enrollmentId={{enrollmentId}}&studentId={{studentId}}&vehicleId={{vehicleId}}&groupId={{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Save an incomplete school-scoped draft without proposing or reserving lessons.
