### Publish a new immutable School rule without weakening verified law.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/scheduling-rule-versions
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 6532147c-d517-563a-b813-56b8f31435c2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
  "ruleType": "MAX_LESSONS_PER_STUDENT_PER_DAY",
  "value": 2,
  "expectedRevision": 0,
  "unit": "Lessons",
  "scopeKind": "School",
  "effectiveFrom": "2030-01-07T08:00:00Z",
  "sourceReference": "urn:vairas:synthetic:school-policy"
}

### Read the identity, revision and verification state of an authorized School rule version.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/schools/{{schoolId}}/scheduling-rule-versions/{{ruleVersionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

